          "guid": "mt4ke1btbtpm5akx",
          "message": {
            "text": "Rewriting only the presentation attribute left a cascade-winning computed-style URL stale in cloned inline SVG. outerHTML encodes url(\"#clip\") as url(&quot;#clip&quot;); before this branch the output referenced a nonexistent old id and the SVG fill-box boundary was dark 4 CSS px past Chromium at both DPR 1 and 2. The encoded-reference unit mutation and live capture-to-SVG rows now pass.",
            "markdown": "Rewriting only the presentation attribute left a cascade-winning computed-style URL stale in cloned inline SVG. outerHTML encodes url(\"#clip\") as url(&quot;#clip&quot;); before this branch the output referenced a nonexistent old id and the SVG fill-box boundary was dark 4 CSS px past Chromium at both DPR 1 and 2. The encoded-reference unit mutation and live capture-to-SVG rows now pass."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/svg-inline.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 48,
                  "endLine": 58,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  out = out.replace(/url\\(\\s*(['\"]?)#([^)'\"\\s]+)\\1\\s*\\)/gi, (_m, quote: string, id: string) => `url(${quote}#${mapped(id)}${quote})`);\n  // DOM `outerHTML` encodes the quotes inside a serialized style attribute,\n  // e.g. `style=\"clip-path: url(&quot;#clip&quot;)\"`.  The presentation\n  // attribute above is namespaced too, but the style declaration wins in the\n  // cascade; leaving its reference stale silently disables the clip. Preserve\n  // the source entity while rewriting its fragment id. This is particularly\n  // visible for objectBoundingBox URL clips on cloned SVG graphics (DM-2362).\n  out = out.replace(\n    /url\\(\\s*(&quot;|&#34;|&#x22;|&apos;|&#39;|&#x27;)#([^&)\\s;]+)\\1\\s*\\)/gi,\n    (_m, quote: string, id: string) => `url(${quote}#${mapped(id)}${quote})`,\n  );"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
